	(text "J4: 1 = +5V, 2 = DIN, 3 = GND. JST-XH side entry (S3B-XH-A), 3 A; full white is ~1.6 A.\nR30 near U1. C30 across J4 pins 1 and 3, at J4.\nStrip: 27 x WS2812B, off-board. No level shifter (works on the breadboard);\nif the strip flickers on rev A, rev B adds a 74AHCT125."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
